@startuml component
!include ../_style/rahyaab-uml.iuml
left to right direction
title Rahyaab components and interfaces (UML component diagram)
package "Student phone" {
  [Mobile app] as App
  [Local store\n(SQLite + SQLCipher)] as Store
  () "IOutbox" as IOutbox
  Store - IOutbox
  App ..> IOutbox : use
}
package "Server" {
  [API\n(FastAPI)] as Api
  [Parent views\n(Jinja2)] as Views
  [rahyaab_scoring] as Scoring
  [Jobs worker] as Jobs
  [PostgreSQL] as Pg
  () "REST /v1" as IRest
  () "HTML /p /c" as IHtml
  () "IScoring" as IScoring
  () "SQL" as ISql
  Api - IRest
  Views - IHtml
  Scoring - IScoring
  Pg - ISql
  Api ..> IScoring : use
  Jobs ..> IScoring : use
  Api ..> ISql : use
  Jobs ..> ISql : use
  Views ..> ISql : use
}
[Dashboard SPA] as Dash
[O*NET Web Services] <<external>> as Onet
() "O*NET API" as IOnet
Onet - IOnet
App ..> IRest : use
Dash ..> IRest : use
Jobs ..> IOnet : use
actor Parent
Parent ..> IHtml : open link
@enduml
